# 1. Supabase Realtime & Edge Functions — powers the online multiplayer arena AND the hosted Cloud Coach proxy.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the two values from your Supabase project (Settings → API).
# Both are public-by-design (the anon key ships in the client bundle).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Set to "true" in production (e.g. GitHub Actions Variables) after deploying `supabase/functions/coach-chat`
# so the public site automatically uses your server-held Claude / OpenAI / Gemini secret key:
# VITE_COACH_EDGE_FUNCTION=true

# 2. Optional Local-Only Direct LLM Keys (for local `npm run dev` only — do NOT set these in public GitHub Pages builds,
# as any `VITE_*` variable is embedded in the browser bundle).
# Alternatively, use Local Ollama (http://localhost:11434) with zero API keys!
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
